{
  "about": "Golden cases for the typed-link fold (server-spec/typed-links.md; check L1). Input: items, the ids a repo's sources produce; prefixes, the id prefixes a source adds to its record ids; records, register lines in order. Expect: related, each item's lines as '<kind or inverse> <other id>', sorted; blocked_by, each dependent item's native blockers, sorted; refused, [record index, rule] in record order. An item with no edge is absent from related.",
